    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>It is the xx model of the largest power class in the trident series,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>in terms of material configuration, it is a power-up version of the rb95sd.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The split configuration is a grip joint + center 2 pieces, ensuring high strength.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>For expert anglers who aim for giant fish from the sea and embankments it is max power trident.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Specifications :<br /><span>Type:&nbsp;Spin&nbsp;<br />Length: 9’3”<br />Line:&nbsp;PE8/10<br />Casting max:&nbsp;gr 200<br />Drag max: 13kg<br />Grips: EVA <br /></span>Guides: Fuji guides</p>",
